  "BK_5010_0040_NAR": "チェシャは[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なに[RUBY:END ]も[RUBY:BASE ]答[RUBY:BEGIN ]こた[RUBY:END ]えず、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]静[RUBY:BEGIN ]しず[RUBY:END ]かに[RUBY:BASE ]目[RUBY:BEGIN ]め[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]閉[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]じました。",
