  "BK_5000_0040_POO": "「おお……[RUBY:BASE ]哀[RUBY:BEGIN ]あわ[RUBY:END ]れなはぐれ[RUBY:BASE ]悪魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]あくま[RUBY:END ]よ。\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]愚[RUBY:BEGIN ]おろ[RUBY:END ]かなる[RUBY:BASE ]小[RUBY:BEGIN ]こ[RUBY:END ]わらわの[RUBY:BASE ]下僕[RUBY:BEGIN ]げぼく[RUBY:END ]から\r\nわれ、お[RUBY:BASE ]前[RUBY:BEGIN ]まえ[RUBY:END ]を[RUBY:BASE ]解[RUBY:BEGIN ]と[RUBY:END ]き[RUBY:BASE ]放[RUBY:BEGIN ]はな[RUBY:END ]たん！\r\n\r\nわれ[RUBY:BASE ]開[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひら[RUBY:END ]きたる[RUBY:BASE ]門[RUBY:BEGIN ]もん[RUBY:END ]をくぐり、\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]魔[RUBY:BEGIN ]ま[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]地[RUBY:BEGIN ]ち[RUBY:END ]へと[RUBY:BASE ]帰[RUBY:BEGIN ]かえ[RUBY:END ]るべし！」",
