  "SM_005020_0170_FAS": "「……おっと、[RUBY:BASE ]湿[RUBY:BEGIN ]しめ[RUBY:END ]っぽい[RUBY:BASE ]話[RUBY:BEGIN ]はなし[RUBY:END ]はこれで[RUBY:BASE ]終[RUBY:BEGIN ]お[RUBY:END ]わりだ。\r\nこの[RUBY:BASE ]先[RUBY:BEGIN ]さき[RUBY:END ]に、[RUBY:BASE ]奴[RUBY:BEGIN ]やつ[RUBY:END ]らが[RUBY:BASE ]必死[RUBY:BEGIN ]ひっし[RUBY:END ]で\r\n[RUBY:BASE ]隠[RUBY:BEGIN ]かく[RUBY:END ]しているものが[RUBY:BASE ]眠[RUBY:BEGIN ]ねむ[RUBY:END ]ってる」",
  "CE_005040_0000_CER": "[RUBY:BASE ]私[RUBY:BEGIN ]わたし[RUBY:END ]の[RUBY:BASE ]魔導術[RUBY:BEGIN ]まどうじゅつ[RUBY:END ]で、[RUBY:BASE ]何[RUBY:BEGIN ]なん[RUBY:END ]だって[RUBY:BASE ]直[RUBY:BEGIN ]なお[RUBY:END ]してみせるわ！",
